Description: Polygons of Mexico from INEGI 2019 and INE 2020 at several
    resolutions (states, municipalities, localities, urban AGEB, blocks and
    electoral sections), and functions to extract the AGEB, blocks and
    sections of a locality. The datasets are GeoParquet files that are
    downloaded the first time they are used and kept in a local cache.
